OL,3,AUS death row inmate survives execution
OL,4,Aattempt after two lethal injections
OL,5,
OL,6,FTennessee death row inmate Christa Pike
OL,7,Fhas been taken to hospital after an
OL,8,Fattempt to execute her by two lethal
OL,9,Finjections failed, her lawyer says.
OL,11,FHer legal team filed an emergency
OL,12,Fmotion to halt the convicted murderer's
OL,13,Fexecution as it was happening, saying:
OL,14,F"Ms Pike has lost consciousness and
OL,15,Fstill has a heartbeat and is audibly
OL,16,Fsnoring."
OL,18,FOne of her attorneys told the BBC that
OL,19,FPike, 50, was now "being provided
OL,20,Flife-saving measures" in hospital after
OL,21,Ftwo syringes of pentobarbital had been
OL,22,Fadministered.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
